  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">YDEEP - Youth Digitalization for Employability and Entrepreneurship Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Youth Digitalization for Employability and Entrepreneurship Program (YDEEP) aims to create digital pathways for youth to not only support their employability, but to enable them to thrive as globally engaged citizens contributing to the sustainable development of their communities and beyond. With a marked focus on bridging the digital inequality gap for youth from underserved communities, the programme equips young people with the necessary 21st century and digital skills they need to prepare for the future of work</narrative>
  </description>
